      "uid": "zhcn:3aee226213f796aa0e362fa6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“在皋月赏与NHK英里赛都表现出色的，\n常识的‘破坏神’！\n谷野美酒！！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ed34696d41b6402bca514e3193670736f02f3107cc13472fd91465f51c1fcf7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
