      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81e8bb503b5180e2910a48b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身为吉兆的训练员，\n我早已决定要与她比肩，以同样的视线与步调\n一起前进，来达成使命了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a38ff9575fabc86a0d91312c9437dffe6cf4fa118831ecc734596365ac534d2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b794dd5b7bc00945c0aae37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，这种不安，\n无论如何总会有办法的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb21a1aed15d3e009f9b72dcc3aae5105f146e941c72111b3655c25ef0586248",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
