      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“此外，再加上她独特的个性，\n掳获了无数人心，\n是现在最受瞩目的赛马娘！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "403bc8291370fa51f53637e082cfc6977f87b104df7c6af4aaab686f5ef6ff63",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
