    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0062d138f5290a910edf4619",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“──不过真是难以置信……！\n皋月后跑了NHK英里C，\n之后又说要跑德比。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "6712ab8d51d114663a6f5cad94c8588448853c17b33de4ae3b13416552411ef9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
