      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“一般是以皋月后跑德比为主，\n但从NHK英里C到德比的话，\n就完全是另一回事啰。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "27fac04015b54c1d66b24811bfc1e8a6a0ae48d4cf7fc15c45499da12f861376",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
