    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fec57bff3f388b6853146d8c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“简单来说，速度至上的1600米，\n与持久力及综合实力最重要的2400米，\n两者所要求的能力并不相同──”",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdd150f3e741e25514b5f50b86f87e108dc03a3089ecdd0314113cf31a6598d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24037fbbc85c887fddab6c3f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "评论员",
      "source_fingerprint": "d370d7d5b07c4a4699b9f2d0596e9a21fa324599b68df12ee0fb6c8835c38f8a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
