    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1138f5c7336b3f208e008b71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“──如果美酒称霸德比，\n就代表她可能同时拥有英里跑者的速度，\n以及在中距离的强大综合实力。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e6c9dc2d6480d9c1108c752e8900c39fca9bd684d885a34fa0571affa7a57f1",
